  "{0} channels": "{0} 声道",
  "A film curve with a real toe and shoulder, warm halation around the lights, and grain that moves. Print stock, not a filter.": "真实的胶片曲线带有暗部趾部和高光肩部，灯光周围有温暖的光晕，颗粒随画面流动。这是印片质感，不只是滤镜。",
  "A matte: blacks lifted, whites eased down, contrast low, and a soft bloom in the light with cream in it. Airy and flattering.": "哑光效果：抬高黑位、压低白位、降低对比度，并在奶油色亮部加入柔和光晕。轻盈且适合人像。",
  "A seventies print: matte blacks and whites, colour faded, greens gone to yellow, a soft vignette.": "七十年代印片质感：黑白两端柔和，色彩褪去，绿色偏黄，并带有轻微暗角。",
  "A warm fade with dust drifting down through it and a light leak in one corner. The CPU shows the fade and a whisper of noise.": "暖色淡化中有尘埃飘落，一角透出漏光。CPU 预览会显示淡化和少量噪点。",
  "Barely there: neutral, a gentle curve, a touch more colour, and the reds calmed so a face reads even. What a talking head wants.": "克制的中性色调：柔和曲线、少量增色，并压低红色，让人脸更均匀。适合口播画面。",
  "Black and white through a coloured filter: red darkens skies and lightens skin, green does the reverse. A little grain if you want it.": "彩色滤镜下的黑白影像：红色滤镜压暗天空、提亮肤色，绿色则相反。还可加入少量颗粒。",
  "Blacks crushed by a film toe, colour drained, bronze through the middle, cool in the shadows, the corners closing in.": "胶片曲线压深黑位，褪去色彩，中间调染上青铜色，阴影偏冷，暗角向内收拢。",
  "Blue in the shadows and midtones, highlights and skin left neutral, contrast up. Cities at dusk.": "阴影和中间调偏蓝，高光与肤色保持中性，同时提高对比度。适合黄昏城市。",
  "Bright and matte: whites soft and cool, blacks lifted well off the floor, colour quiet. The clean minimal look of a white room.": "明亮的哑光风格：白色柔和偏冷，黑位明显抬升，色彩克制，呈现白色空间的极简质感。",
  "Colour bleeding sideways, scan lines, softness, tape noise and too much saturation, with the slight vertical smear of a worn head.": "色彩横向溢出、扫描线、柔化、磁带噪点和过饱和，带有旧磁头造成的轻微垂直拖影。",
  "Colour that sings and contrast that bites, with a little edge: the look that reads as a better camera. Skin is held back from the boost.": "色彩更鲜活、对比更有力，边缘略微锐化，像是升级了相机；肤色不会被过度增强。",
  "Cool, hazy and drained, with the wet reflections lifted and blooming. Street-level walks at the end of the day.": "冷调、薄雾与低饱和度，提亮并柔化潮湿路面的倒影。适合傍晚街景。",
  "Dark lines across the picture every few pixels, the way a tube television drew it.": "每隔几个像素在画面上绘制暗线，模拟显像管电视的扫描方式。",
  "Daylight footage made to pop: midtones lifted, colour brought up where it is muted, a breath of mint in the brightest whites, skin left alone.": "让日光画面更鲜明：提亮中间调、增强偏淡的色彩，在最亮的白色中加入一丝薄荷色，同时保留自然肤色。",
  "Deep blacks, a cool cast over everything but the lamps, colour low, a little grain. Late-night desk and monologue footage.": "深黑位、灯光以外的画面整体偏冷、低饱和度并带少量颗粒。适合深夜桌面和独白镜头。",
  "Drained colour, a green-cyan cast, a hard toe, and a heavy vignette. For the season.": "褪色画面带青绿色调，暗部压得更深，并加重暗角，营造阴森的氛围。",
  "Every colour turned around the wheel by the same angle.": "所有颜色在色轮上按相同角度旋转。",
  "Everything brighter than the threshold turns negative, as an over-exposed print does.": "高于阈值的部分转为负片效果，如同过度曝光的照片。",
  "Exposure is in stops; the rest is a signed percent of the picture as shot, and zero everywhere is the picture as shot. Double-click a label to put it back; the diamond keys the knob at the playhead.": "曝光以档位计，其余参数以相对原片的正负百分比表示；全部为零即原片效果。双击标签可重置，点击菱形可在播放头处添加关键帧。",
  "Faces brightened and evened: skin lifted, reds calmed, the balance neutral, the rest of the frame left where it was.": "提亮并均匀人脸：抬升肤色、压低红色、保持中性色彩平衡，画面其他部分不变。",
  "Flat bands of colour with inked edges, like a printed comic.": "将色彩分成平涂色块并勾勒墨线，呈现印刷漫画风格。",
  "Late light: a warm balance that keeps its brightness, orange in the highlights, a whisper of magenta in the shadows, blacks lifted a touch.": "傍晚光线：保持明亮的暖色平衡，高光偏橙，阴影略带洋红，黑位轻微抬升。",
  "Low contrast, pink and lavender in the light, and a soft bloom over it all. The dreamy one.": "低对比度，亮部带粉色和薰衣草紫，整体覆以柔和光晕，呈现梦幻质感。",
  "Low light opened up: shadows lifted with the noise softened before it rises, whites held, the blue of the night kept.": "提亮低光画面的阴影，同时抑制随之出现的噪点，保住白位和夜色中的蓝调。",
  "Magenta in the shadows, cyan in the highlights, hard contrast, colour turned up, and the lights themselves blooming. Night streets and signage.": "阴影偏洋红、高光偏青，对比强烈、色彩浓郁，灯光带有光晕。适合夜晚街道与招牌。",
  "Milk's warm twin: the same soft matte with cream in the whites and a little gold in the middle. Interiors and morning light.": "奶白效果的暖色版本：同样柔和的哑光质感，白色带奶油色，中间调微泛金色。适合室内和晨光。",
  "Muted and green-teal through the midtones, a gentle film curve, warmth only where a face is. The quiet grade of an indie film.": "降低饱和度，中间调偏青绿，采用柔和胶片曲线，只在人脸处保留暖意，呈现独立电影的克制调色。",
  "Night city: the lights and signs made vivid and blooming, blacks kept deep and cool, faces left clean. Made for the strip.": "夜色城市：灯光和招牌鲜明并带光晕，黑位深而冷，人脸保持干净。适合霓虹街景。",
  "Off, a click on the ruler past the last clip lands the playhead there, and a clip placed at the playhead goes with it. On, the playhead never leaves the content.": "关闭时，点击最后一个片段之后的标尺会将播放头移到那里，在播放头处插入的片段也会放在那里。开启后，播放头不会超出内容范围。",
  "One title per sentence, held for as long as it takes to read, one after another on the first lane with room.": "每句话生成一条文字片段，按阅读所需时长依次放在第一个有空位的轨道上。",
  "Pure black and pure white, cut at one level of brightness.": "按亮度阈值将画面切分为纯黑与纯白。",
  "Red and blue pulled apart, the colour fringing of a cheap lens.": "将红蓝通道错开，模拟廉价镜头的彩色边缘。",
  "Sepia that keeps its contrast and its highlights, so it reads as old film rather than a brown wash.": "保留对比度和高光的棕褐色调，呈现老胶片质感，而不是简单的棕色覆盖。",
  "Showing the look over the picture. Double-click the card, or its plus, to lay it on the timeline": "正在画面上预览此效果。双击卡片或点击加号可将其添加到时间线。",
  "Skies deeper and bluer, foliage cooler and calmer, the rest of the picture and every face untouched. Travel footage.": "天空更深更蓝，植被更冷、更克制，画面其他部分和人脸保持不变。适合旅行素材。",
  "Skin warmed toward peach and softened, shadows lifted so lines ease, contrast low. Portraits and talking heads; it is meant to run at half strength.": "肤色偏暖、接近蜜桃色并得到柔化；提亮阴影以减轻纹理，降低对比度。适合人像和口播，建议以半强度使用。",
  "Soft cinema: blacks lifted, the light blooming warm, shadows a touch cool, skin kept. The look of a story told in a window seat.": "柔和电影感：抬升黑位，亮部泛起暖色光晕，阴影略冷，保留自然肤色，如同窗边讲述的故事。",
  "Soft green through the midtones and whites, colour muted, a light matte. The trend look, gentle enough for a face.": "中间调和白色透出柔和绿色，色彩克制，带轻微哑光质感，对人脸也足够温和。",
  "Teal in the shadows, orange in the highlights, skin held as skin, a film curve over it. The blockbuster grade, and the most requested look there is.": "阴影偏青、高光偏橙，肤色保持自然，再叠加胶片曲线。这是常见的商业电影调色风格。",
  "The 2000s point-and-shoot: hard flash, whites blown, colour up, a cool cyan cast, over-sharpened with the sensor's noise.": "千禧年代便携数码相机：强烈闪光、过曝白位、浓艳色彩、偏冷的青色调，伴有过度锐化和传感器噪点。",
  "The café look: warm brown through the middle, greens muted to olive, contrast eased. Cosy, and kind to wood and skin alike.": "咖啡馆氛围：中间调偏暖棕，绿色压成橄榄色，对比度放缓，对木质和肤色都很友好。",
  "The instant print: a cream matte, warm highlights, cyan creeping into the shadows, a little softness in the corners.": "即时成像质感：奶油色哑光、暖高光、阴影微青，边角略显柔和。",
  "The picture pressed into relief, lit from the top left.": "将画面压出浮雕效果，仿佛由左上方照亮。",
  "The picture's edges drawn over it in its own colours.": "用画面自身的颜色描绘边缘线条。",
  "Water and sky turned aquamarine and brightened, sand and skin left warm and clean. The beach-day look creators reach for first.": "将水和天空调成明亮的海蓝色，沙滩与肤色保持温暖干净，适合海滨日光素材。",
  "1 stroke": "1 笔",
  "A brighter, lighter, closer voice. Pitch at 0 follows the amount.": "更明亮、更轻盈、更贴近的声音。音高为 0 时跟随强度。",
  "A concert hall: long, even reflections.": "音乐厅：悠长而均匀的反射。",
  "A flat, boxy blur.": "平直的方形模糊。",
  "A handheld jitter.": "手持拍摄般的抖动。",
  "A horizontal streak, as if the camera panned.": "水平拖影，如同镜头横摇。",
  "A layer treats everything under it for as long as it runs. Trim it on the timeline to change what it covers.": "图层在持续期间处理其下方的一切。在时间线上修剪它即可改变覆盖范围。",
  "A metallic, modulated voice.": "金属质感、经过调制的声音。",
  "A small old speaker: no top end, and a grain to the sound.": "一只老旧的小喇叭：没有高频，声音带着颗粒感。",
  "A small speaker on a long wave: narrow band, a little crunch.": "长波收音机的小喇叭：窄频带，略带杂音。",
  "A soft bloom around the bright parts of the picture.": "画面明亮处周围柔和的光晕。",
  "A soft shadow under the words, for titles that have to sit over footage you do not control.": "文字下方的柔和阴影，适合叠在无法控制的素材上的字幕。",
  "A soft, even blur.": "柔和均匀的模糊。",
  "A solid band behind the words. Where a shadow softens the background, a plate replaces it — use it when the footage underneath is busy enough that neither weight nor outline will hold.": "文字后方的实色底板。阴影是柔化背景，底板则是遮住背景——当下方素材过于杂乱、字重和描边都不够用时使用。",
  "A studio plate: dense, bright and short.": "录音室板式混响：密实、明亮、短促。",
