  "Auto removal keeps what the model finds and drops the rest: a person, or the one thing the picture is of. Custom removal starts from the same mask and takes corrections painted on the monitor: the smart brush keeps the whole thing it touches and the smart eraser removes it, the plain ones do exactly what you paint; Apply ends the painting. Chroma key drops one colour instead; similarity is how far from the colour still counts, softness feathers the edge.": "“自动移除”保留模型找到的内容并去掉其余部分：一个人物，或画面所拍的那一样东西。“自定义移除”从同一蒙版出发，接受在监视器上涂画的修正：智能画笔保留它触到的整个物体，智能橡皮则整个去掉，普通工具完全按你涂画的执行；点“应用”结束涂画。“色度键”则是抠掉一种颜色；相似度决定与该颜色相差多远仍算在内，柔和度决定边缘羽化程度。",
